# Plan files written by the Copilot agents in .github/agents (plan -> implement).
#
# basic.mjs keeps its plan directory outside the workspace, so plans and refined
# prompts are never part of the project. A Copilot agent can only write inside
# the repository, so the same rule is kept with a git-ignored directory: the
# plan file is a working note the implement phase can resume from, not source.
.copilot/plans/
